    "# 13. Use case: supplier ranking filtered to certified-halal manufacturers\n",
    "For each held-out test food we rank **all** manufacturers by model score and then keep only manufacturers that supply at least one certified\n",
    "food **in the TRAIN edges** (so the filter cannot use held-out labels). When the true manufacturer is excluded by the filter it is\n",
    "**counted and reported**, not silently skipped."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-13T03:49:31.319545Z",
